---
// CoreOfferings.astro
---
<section id="services" class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-brand-ghost relative border-y border-brand-ash overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-indigo/6 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-16 items-start">

      {/* Left — What We Offer */}
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 animate-on-scroll">
        <span class="badge-coral mb-4">Our Services</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-midnight mb-6 mt-4">Everything your business needs to win online.</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-brand-slate mb-10">
          We handle your entire digital presence — from design and development to search visibility and ongoing support. You focus on your customers; we handle the rest.
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl hover:bg-white hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all duration-300 border border-transparent hover:border-brand-indigo/10 group">
            <div class="mt-0.5 w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-indigo/10 border border-brand-indigo/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:bg-brand-indigo group-hover:text-white text-brand-indigo">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-brand-midnight font-bold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-indigo transition-colors">Custom Website Design</h4>
              <p class="text-brand-slate text-sm leading-relaxed">A high-converting, mobile-first website coded from scratch. No page builders, no themes — just a site built to get your phone ringing.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl hover:bg-white hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all duration-300 border border-transparent hover:border-brand-cyan/10 group">
            <div class="mt-0.5 w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-cyan/10 border border-brand-cyan/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:bg-brand-cyan group-hover:text-white text-brand-cyan">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-brand-midnight font-bold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-cyan transition-colors">Local SEO Foundation</h4>
              <p class="text-brand-slate text-sm leading-relaxed">Google Business Profile setup, on-page SEO, structured data, and local keyword targeting — so nearby customers find you first.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl hover:bg-white hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all duration-300 border border-transparent hover:border-brand-coral/10 group">
            <div class="mt-0.5 w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-coral/10 border border-brand-coral/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:bg-brand-coral group-hover:text-white text-brand-coral">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-brand-midnight font-bold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand-coral transition-colors">Ongoing Maintenance & Support</h4>
              <p class="text-brand-slate text-sm leading-relaxed">Secure hosting, software updates, regular backups, and priority support. Your website stays fast, safe, and up to date — always.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Right — How It Works */}
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay: 0.15s;">
        <span class="badge-indigo mb-4">How It Works</span>
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-midnight mb-10 mt-4">From first call to live website — here's exactly what to expect.</h3>

        <div class="space-y-0">

          {/* Step 1 */}
          <div class="flex gap-5 relative pb-10 group">
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center shrink-0">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-midnight text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(10,25,47,0.3)] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">1</div>
              <div class="w-px flex-1 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-midnight/50 to-brand-ash mt-3"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-2">
              <h4 class="text-brand-midnight font-bold mb-1 transition-colors">Free Strategy Call <span class="text-xs font-normal text-brand-slate ml-1">— 30 min</span></h4>
              <p class="text-brand-slate text-sm leading-relaxed">We learn about your business, your customers, and your goals. No pitch, no pressure — just an honest conversation about whether we're the right fit.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* Step 2 */}
          <div class="flex gap-5 relative pb-10 group">
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center shrink-0">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-indigo text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(79,70,229,0.4)] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">2</div>
              <div class="w-px flex-1 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-indigo/50 to-brand-ash mt-3"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-2">
              <h4 class="text-brand-midnight font-bold mb-1 transition-colors">We Build Your Website <span class="text-xs font-normal text-brand-slate ml-1">— within a week</span></h4>
              <p class="text-brand-slate text-sm leading-relaxed">We design, build, and test your site. You review it and give feedback. We iterate until it's exactly right — then we launch.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* Step 3 */}
          <div class="flex gap-5 relative group">
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center shrink-0">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(6,182,212,0.4)] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">3</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-brand-midnight font-bold mb-1 transition-colors">Ongoing Growth & Support <span class="text-xs font-normal text-brand-slate ml-1">— monthly</span></h4>
              <p class="text-brand-slate text-sm leading-relaxed">We handle hosting, maintenance, and continued SEO improvements. Cancel anytime — we earn your business every month.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-brand-midnight/5 border border-brand-midnight/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-slate"><span class="font-semibold text-brand-midnight">Ready to start?</span> Book your free 30-minute call to get started. We'll review your current online presence and tell you exactly what needs to change — even if you don't hire us.</p>
          <button data-open-modal="auditModal" class="btn-coral text-sm px-6 py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap group flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shrink-0 cursor-pointer">
            Get Free Audit
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
